Z||000004||GT GT 87||05-10-2001||08:42 PM||||Why buy 16 when you need 12?????????  I have heard the added ratio will be hard on valve guides!!  Buy the righ cam first and use standard ratio roller tips  !  If the cam is not hot enough then put 1.6 on the intake only , you can get maybe 5 h.p. but not needed on the exhaust.... NOW then , if you have a stock cam , then  perhaps it would be cool on both.... But buy 60* v-6 ones !  I think if you go SBC you will need 7/16 studs installed !!!!!||||reg||1
